workflowhierarchy

Work space — the overall planned work for a group of stakeholders
Workflow — a defined sequence of work within the plan.
Task — an executable group of elements.
Subtask — a step-by-step subdivision of a task.

Hierarchy:
Work Plan → Workflow → Task → Subtask

